ADD_JOURNAL @65 @68 @3003 @3000 @1455 USING ~Faren/translations/%LANGUAGE%/fhfseth.tra~ ~Faren/translations/%LANGUAGE%/journals.tra~ ~Faren/translations/%LANGUAGE%/fhfrnj.tra~
